    "name_raw": "Deafening Critical",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat, Critical",
    "source_book_raw": "PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 121",
    "definition_raw": "Source PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 121\nYour critical hits cause enemies to lose their hearing.\n\nPrerequisites: Critical Focus, base attack bonus +13.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you score a critical hit against an opponent, the victim is permanently deafened. A successful Fortitude save reduces the deafness to 1 round. The DC of this Fortitude save is equal to 10 + your base attack bonus. This feat has no effect on deaf creatures. This deafness can be cured by heal, regeneration, remove deafness, or a similar ability.\n\nSpecial: You can only apply the effects of one critical feat to a given critical hit unless you possess Critical Mastery.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 121",
        "href_raw": "http://paizo.com/pathfinderRPG/v5748btpy88yj",
